{"id":5032892136,"name":"An Infinite Road Trip","desc":"Search for colas, discover secrets, and experience unique events on a red pickup truck speeding down an endless road! What will you find?\n\nThis game is a complete remake of Train Trip Simulator (by me, ThatIsSuperFunny), which was inspired from Bus Simulator (by NobleReign).\n\nPremium Benefits:\n-Premium Cola\n-Golden Message Text in Window Chat\n-Dark Theme Chat Bubbles in Bubble Chat\n\n\nWhat's New?\n* Updated the game's chat system to the newer TextChatService, as required by Roblox\n+ Player names once again have random colors, as is the default for Roblox games\n* Premium players now have golden message text instead of golden names in window chat\n+ Premium players now also have unique dark-theme message bubbles","path":"/game/5032892136-an-infinite-road-trip","slug":"5032892136-an-infinite-road-trip","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ed0271a82cce2668b1c9045596dd5556931c53d1d3af2b0683d05821c0d3bf54.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f438aae5faaa22b43018199c6ba6601a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":31,"visitor":129627901,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-03-15T18:40:08.217Z","creator":{"name":"Front-Tier","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"65f4960858cecba2d55c9b8b","title":"singing car","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d71","gameId":5032892136,"name":"An Infinite Road Trip","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ed0271a82cce2668b1c9045596dd5556931c53d1d3af2b0683d05821c0d3bf54.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f438aae5faaa22b43018199c6ba6601a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"5032892136-an-infinite-road-trip","path":"/game/5032892136-an-infinite-road-trip","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ed0271a82cce2668b1c9045596dd5556931c53d1d3af2b0683d05821c0d3bf54.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f438aae5faaa22b43018199c6ba6601a/150/150/Image/Pn